vs_tex2d_cube_deqp.vert (the vertex shader of dEQP-GLES2.functional.uniform_api.value.assigned.*.render.basic_struct.sampler2D_samplerCube_vertex, VK-GL-CTS 93bca01 es2fUniformApiTests.cpp) with the struct's two members declared as the plain uniforms u_var_m0 and u_var_m1, so that tools/mali/gl_ref.py gives each its texture and its unit (0 and 1, the values dEQP sets): plan #406 item vs2tex-ref, issue #11308. Drawn with `tools/mali/drm_shim_ref.sh run <shim> vs_tex2d_cube.vert vs_tex2d_cube.frag tools/mali/testdata/vs_tex2d_cube --uniform-values` (.trace, .stdout, .stderr) and `tools/mali/pan_ref_diff.py extract vs_tex2d_cube.trace --draw` (.expect.json), which is what `tools/mali/deqp_ref.sh ... --instrument shim` writes.
